<div class="container section-space">
  <header class="page-heading"><h1>About the group</h1><p>Metrics and Models is a seminar series for health and social data science, organised at the University of Oxford.</p></header>
  <section class="editorial-section"><h2>Research</h2><div class="prose"><p>We have a broad interest in the metrics and models used across health and social data science. The seminars are a place to discuss new research and work in progress.</p><p>Our <a href="/people/">organising team</a> brings together people from Oxford's Demographic Science Unit, Engineering Science, Oxford Internet Institute, and Sociology.</p></div></section>
  <section class="editorial-section" id="join"><h2>Attending</h2><div class="prose"><p>We meet online every other Thursday at 14:00 UK time (GMT or BST). The seminars are open to everyone, including people outside academia.</p><p>Subscribe to the mailing list for invitations and joining information, or register using the form.</p><div class="inline-links"><a class="text-link" href="{{ site.subscribe }}">Subscribe by email {% icon "mail" %}</a><a class="text-link" href="{{ site.registration }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Registration form {% icon "arrow-up-right" %}</a></div><p class="small muted">Oxford colleagues can also <a href="https://web.maillist.ox.ac.uk/ox/info/metrics_and_models" target="_blank" rel="noopener">subscribe through the mailing-list service</a>.</p></div></section>
  <section class="editorial-section"><h2>Giving a talk</h2><div class="prose"><p>Suggestions for future seminars are welcome.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://forms.office.com/e/KsFZYcMz5C" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Propose a talk {% icon "arrow-up-right" %}</a></div></section>
  <section class="editorial-section"><h2>Internal sessions</h2><div class="prose"><p>In the off-weeks, the local group meets for informal presentations, feedback, and discussion. These sessions are for members of the internal mailing list.</p><p>See the <a href="/details/internal_lab_sessions.html">lab schedule</a>, or <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">email us</a> to join the local list.</p></div></section>
